  "title": "Noodles Romanoff I",
  "description": "Warm and comforting, this creamy casserole of egg noodles, cottage cheese and sour cream gets a dose of piquant flavoring from minced onion and garlic, Worcestershire sauce and a dash of red pepper sauce.",
